.TH PASTE 1 "2026" "KERNEL32" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
paste \- fusionne les lignes de fichiers / merge lines of files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B paste
[-s] [-d list] file...
.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes lines of each file side by side separated by tabs. With -s pastes each file on one line.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -d list
Delimiters used in turn.
.TP
.B -s
One file per line.
.SH SEE ALSO
cut(1)
